## Title: Mic Toggle
## Author: @Dicen95728
## Version: 1.6
## AddOnVersion: 1
## APIVersion: 101050
## OptionalDependsOn: LibAddonMenu-2.0
## Description: Mute/unmute yourself in voice chat via a bindable button (set in settings or /mic bind) or the /mic chat command. Muting stops transmitting but keeps you in the channel so you still hear everyone.
MicToggle.lua
Bindings.xml

# Bindings.xml is listed explicitly: console does not auto-load it (PC does).
